scope one send, one red of my own found at the close and repaired
status GREEN -- demo_output, unshared_citation, vocabulary_collection, geode_libraries, reds_ledger_monotone and the pin bound all green on metal; remember_git_nib green after this commit
recommend keep-going -- the sibling guard's derived run roster declines one demos fence; widening it there is the cheaper half of the ruling the card now asks for
